<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#hasChecksum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The applicable SHACL profile determines which fixed resource is being checked. A checksum establishes fixity only for the declared bytes or canonical materialization and does not establish authenticity or truth."@en .
